    "description": "Academic Group formation APIs (stepwise wizard).\n\n**Docs:** `docs/postman/ACADEMIC_GROUP.md`\n\n## Create order\n1. `POST /academicGroup/scope` → `academicGroupScopeId`\n2. `POST /academicGroup` → `academicGroupId`\n3. `POST /academicGroup/user` → faculty\n4. `POST /academicGroup/student` → students\n\nThen PATCH/GET/DELETE as needed.\n\n## Pickers\n- `GET /options/studentFilters`\n- `GET /academicGroup/availableStudents`\n- `GET /academicGroup/availableUsers`\n- `GET /options/teachers`\n\nSet `baseurl` + `token`. Tenant from `saveUserDefaults`.\n\n**Note:** when `academicContextType` is `course`, send `contextSubjectId` (subject FK), not a course id.",
